libpng is the reference library for reading and writing PNG images, needed by
freetype, cairo and most graphics software. Installs the shared library, headers,
libpng.pc and the libpng-config, png-fix-itxt and pngfix tools under /usr/local.
upstream: https://www.libpng.org/pub/png/libpng.html
